mareader-phonon ports Gradium's Phonon text-to-speech model to Rust and candle.

The port follows xn-ptts (https://github.com/gradium-ai/xn-ptts), Gradium's
own runtime: its flow language model, flow head, Mimi decoder, text plan,
end-of-speech rule and English text normalisation, whose domain list keeps
only IANA's country codes and generic names. xn-ptts is dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; this port
