The model, Phonon 31M by Gradium (https://huggingface.co/gradium/phonon-31m-en),
is Apache-2.0, as are its voices (https://huggingface.co/gradium/phonon-voices).
It builds on Kyutai's Pocket TTS and Mimi codec. Neither weights nor voices
are part of this crate; the app downloads them on request.

The tokenizer reproduces the unigram model of Hugging Face's tokenizers
(Apache-2.0) from each checkpoint's own tokenizer.json.
